description	"The Jedi Weaponsmaster

The Jedi Weaponsmaster forgoes virtually all force abilities in exchange for amazing offensive and defensive lightsaber abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^2All ^7Single + Staff Styles
-- Saber Defense   (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
-- Attack-Defense (Q3)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Speed (3)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Utterly dominant in lightsaber skills.
^1Weaknesses^7: No real force powers to speak of."